;; Samus's mini game, Zebes Escape: Tourian, at the bottom of Zebes, then the climb out. Six screens
;; wide and four high (`camera: free`, `height: 60`), in four rooms, each a whole number of
;; screens, the camera kept inside the one Samus is in (stage.ts ROOMS):
;;   corridor  x 0-31,  rows 45-59  the start, a step, the morph-ball wall (a bomb block in its
;;                                  tunnel), a cannon and a Rinka spawner
;;   hall      x 32-47, rows 45-59  a cannon, a Rinka spawner, the red door (missiles)
;;   brain     x 48-79, rows 45-59  three barriers under walls from the ceiling, cannons, Rinkas,
;;                                  the brain's tank under a wall (the way to the shaft behind it)
;;   shaft     x 80-95, rows 0-59   the escape: tube platforms three rows apart up to the surface
;;                                  (row 3, a mouth at x 83-89); standing on it ends the round
;; Doors stand in pairs in the gaps of the walls between rooms (rows 54-56). stage.ts loads the
;; map with ?raw, so it is not in the level library, the dev level select or the campaign.
id: zebes-escape
name: ZEBES ESCAPE
world: 4
stage: 2
theme: tourian
music: tourian
time: 400
start: 3,56
startMode: stand
camera: free
height: 60

[tiles]
